    <reapack name="Open Melodyne (Andrey Novikov).lua" type="script" desc="Open Melodyne (Andrey Novikov)">
      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi Prepare active Melodyne on selected tracks or takes and show one window. REAPER 7.06+ and Melodyne required.}</description>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.1.0" author="Andrey Novikov" time="2026-11-05T13:21:30Z">
        <changelog>Open one Melodyne window for the whole selection. Reuse an existing window and close extra active Melodyne interfaces on selected targets. Add ReaPack distribution and author branding.</changelog>
        <source file="Open Melodyne (Andrey Novikov).lua" main="main">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreynovikov86-cmd/ReaScripts/587f5f0ca69b714ac8c214f5018ed4379fe84f05/Andrey%20Novikov_Open%20Melodyne.lua</source>
      </version>
    </reapack>
  </category>
  <category name="Items">
    <reapack name="Render Take FX and Bypass Originals FX (Andrey Novikov).lua" type="script" desc="Render Take FX and Bypass Originals FX (Andrey Novikov)">
      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi Render selected items with Take FX to new takes, then bypass original Take FX. Preserve track FX states and item selection.}</description>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.2.1" author="Andrey Novikov" time="2026-11-05T13:21:30Z">
        <changelog>Publish branded ReaPack package. Rendering behavior unchanged from 1.2.</changelog>
        <source file="Render Take FX and Bypass Originals FX (Andrey Novikov).lua" main="main">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreynovikov86-cmd/ReaScripts/587f5f0ca69b714ac8c214f5018ed4379fe84f05/Andrey%20Novikov_Render%20Take%20FX%20and%20Bypass%20Originals%20FX.lua</source>
      </version>
    </reapack>
    <reapack name="exploit stereo audio (Andrey Novikov).lua" type="script" desc="Explode Stereo Audio (Andrey Novikov)">
      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi Split stereo items to real mono WAV files on shared L/R child tracks. Source tracks become folders. Pair groups, hard panning, copied and bypassed Take FX. REAPER 7.46+.}</description>
      </metadata>
      <version name="1.0.0" author="Andrey Novikov" time="2026-11-05T14:00:00Z">
        <changelog>Initial release. One shared L/R pair per source track; real mono float32 files, folder routing, paired item groups, naming and Undo. Extract raw audio and preserve Take FX on both mono takes in bypass.</changelog>
        <source file="exploit stereo audio (Andrey Novikov).lua" main="main">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreynovikov86-cmd/ReaScripts/2d0b7a6e212bd00672a8a310d56391ff5046641e/Andrey%20Novikov_exploit%20stereo%20audio.lua</source>
        <source file="exploit stereo audio_README_RU.md">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreynovikov86-cmd/ReaScripts/2d0b7a6e212bd00672a8a310d56391ff5046641e/docs/exploit-stereo-audio_RU.md</source>
      </version>
      <version name="1.0.1" author="Andrey Novikov" time="2026-11-06T01:14:36Z">
        <changelog>Correct the name to Explode Stereo Audio, capitalize the action title and rename its installed file. Audio processing is unchanged. Existing shortcuts may need to be assigned to the renamed action once.</changelog>
        <source file="Explode Stereo Audio (Andrey Novikov).lua" main="main">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andreynovikov86-cmd/ReaScripts/fee005a61d7b892e9ec41935e4ae2cf35e25fb0a/Andrey%20Novikov_Explode%20Stereo%20Audio.lua</source>
